# PR Feedback Handling

See AGENTS/09-pr-feedback.md for full detail and the comment→fix mapping table.

When asked to "fix PR comments", "address review feedback", or "fix Copilot comments on PR #N":

## Step 1 — Fetch comments
```bash
gh api repos/nuxeo/agentic-ui-poc/pulls/<N>/comments \
  | jq '.[] | { path: .path, line: .line, body: .body, id: .id }'
```

## Step 2 — Fix each comment
- Read the file at the specified line
- Understand the intent — do NOT just suppress lint errors
- Implement the correct fix per AGENTS/03-angular-conventions.md and AGENTS/07-security.md

## Step 3 — Verify and commit
```bash
npx nx affected -t lint && npx nx affected -t build && npx nx affected -t test
git commit -m "fix: address PR #<N> review comments"
git push
```

## Common fixes
- "Missing unsubscribe" → add `takeUntilDestroyed()`
- "Object URL not revoked" → add cleanup array + ngOnDestroy
- "Direct img src to Nuxeo URL" → fetch via service + blob URL
- "Potential XSS" → replace innerHTML with Angular template binding
- "Hardcoded credential" → move to process.env + startup validation
- "Race condition" → add stale-uid check before setting signal
- "No error handling" → add error branch that resets loading signal
